# hyperbox — open VOICE and play the lead by hand, which is what v2 added.
# The transport AUTO-STARTS as of v2, so this clip must NOT press SPACE (that would stop it). v1's
# version of this clip did exactly that, because v1 booted stopped and a headless render was silence.
# White keys are ~22px wide from x=2 once VOICE is open; y=130 is below the black keys.
click 20 40 22        # focus VOICE (its strip is 14..32 while DRUMS is open)
press 45 13 130       # hold the root
release 70 13 130
press 80 58 130       # a third up — RETUNE decides whether this JUMPS or slides
release 105 58 130
press 115 104 130
release 145 104 130
press 155 149 130
release 185 149 130
